{"nodes": [{"id": "real_equity_multi_pair_real_docs_equity", "label": "Multi-Pair Equity Curves \u2014 Real Data (~2 Years)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/images/real/equity-multi-pair-real.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "Line chart showing equity curves for 8 currency pairs over approximately 2 years of real trading data. Title: 'Equity curves \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0445 8 \u043f\u0430\u0440 \u2014 \u0420\u0415\u0410\u041b\u042c\u041d\u042b\u0415 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0437\u0430 ~2 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430 / \u0416\u0451\u0441\u0442\u043a\u0430\u044f \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430 \u043e \u0431\u044d\u043a\u0442\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0435 vs. multi-pair'. Pairs shown with cumulative returns: EURUSD (+11.78), GBPUSD (+9.98), AUDUSD (+14.5B), NZDUSD (+13.24), USDJPY (+5.38), USDCAD (+21.58), EURJPY (-20.33), GBPJPY (-13.26). X-axis: \u043d\u043e\u043c\u0435\u0440 \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u043a\u0438 (trade number, 0\u2013225). Y-axis: \u043a\u0443\u043c\u0443\u043b\u044f\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434 (%) (cumulative return %). Most pairs show positive returns trending upward; EURJPY and GBPJPY show significant drawdowns, illustrating the value of multi-pair diversification vs. single-pair backtesting."}, {"id": "real_equity_multi_pair_real_docs_concept_multi_pair_backtesting", "label": "Multi-Pair Backtesting Concept", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/images/real/equity-multi-pair-real.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "real_equity_multi_pair_real_docs_pair_eurusd", "label": "EURUSD equity curve (+11.78%)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/images/real/equity-multi-pair-real.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at